+### Out-of-office delegation
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/out-of-office` with `{"delegate":"cat"}` reassigns every task assigned to `{uid}` in the organization's active projects to `delegate`, and returns the moved tasks (200).
+
+- Only org admins of `{orgID}` may call it (other callers: 403; callers from another org: 404). This is the one write org admins may perform.
+- `{uid}` must belong to `{orgID}`, otherwise 404.
+- `delegate` must be a different user in the same organization, and a contributor or manager of every affected project, otherwise 400.
+- Tasks in archived projects are not moved, because archived projects reject writes.
+- All-or-nothing: if any check fails, no task is changed.
+
